<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Fallout — La Sainte Liste</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=VT323&family=Share+Tech+Mono&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #1a1a12;
    --terminal: #4b5e2e;
    --terminal-bright: #9fbf3f;
    --card: #23231a;
    --border: #4b4b33;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    background-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #2a2a1a 0%, #1a1a12 70%);
    color: var(--terminal-bright);
    font-family: 'Share Tech Mono', monospace;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }
  a { color: var(--terminal-bright); }
  header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    border: 2px solid var(--terminal-bright);
    padding: 20px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }
  header h1 {
    font-family: 'VT323', monospace;
    font-size: 4rem;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--terminal-bright);
  }
  header p {
    color: var(--terminal);
    margin: 5px 0 0 0;
  }
  .back {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--terminal-bright);
  }
  .back:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  section {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px auto;
  }
  section h2 {
    font-family: 'VT323', monospace;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--terminal);
    padding-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .entry {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .entry .name { font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .tag {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .canon { background: #4a7c1e; color: #eaffcc; }
  .semi { background: #8a6a1e; color: #ffedcc; }
  .non { background: #7c1e1e; color: #ffcccc; }
  .meta { color: var(--terminal); font-size: 0.85rem; }

  #comments {
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    border: 1px dashed var(--terminal);
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--terminal);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<a class="back" href="index.html">&larr; Retour à l'accueil</a>

<header>
  <h1>FALLOUT</h1>
  <p>War never changes — chronologie &amp; canon</p>
</header>

<section>
  <h2>Origin Lore / Côte Ouest</h2>

  <div class="entry">
    <span class="name">Fallout 1</span>
    <span class="meta">PC — 1997</span>
    <span class="tag canon">Canon</span>
  </div>

  <div class="entry">
    <span class="name">Fallout 2</span>
    <span class="meta">PC — 1998</span>
    <span class="tag canon">Canon</span>
  </div>

  <div class="entry">
    <span class="name">Fallout Tactics</span>
    <span class="meta">PC — 2001</span>
    <span class="tag semi">Semi-canon</span>
  </div>

  <div class="entry">
    <span class="name">Fallout Bible</span>
    <span class="meta">Livre — 2002</span>
    <span class="tag semi">Semi-canon</span>
  </div>

  <div class="entry">
    <span class="name">Fallout: Van Buren</span>
    <span class="meta">PC — 2003</span>
    <span class="tag semi">Semi-canon</span>
  </div>

  <div class="entry">
    <span class="name">Fallout: Brotherhood of Steel</span>
    <span class="meta">PS2 — 2004</span>
    <span class="tag non">Non canon</span>
  </div>

  <div class="entry">
    <span class="name">All Roads Lead To Vegas</span>
    <span class="meta">Comics — 2010</span>
    <span class="tag canon">Canon</span>
  </div>

  <div class="entry">
    <span class="name">Fallout: New Vegas</span>
    <span class="meta">PC — 2010</span>
    <span class="tag canon">Canon</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Bethesda Lore / Côte Est</h2>

  <div class="entry">
    <span class="name">One Man and a Crate of Puppets</span>
    <span class="meta">2011</span>
    <span class="tag semi">Semi-canon</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="comments">
  Emplacement réservé pour les commentaires (Cusdis à intégrer ici)
</section>

</body>
</html>
